## Architecture Integration

### Leverage Existing Components
- **MCP Tools**: Always check [src-tauri/mcp-server-os-level/](mdc:src-tauri/mcp-server-os-level) for existing functionality
- **Platform APIs**: Use established patterns from [platforms/macos/](mdc:src-tauri/mcp-server-os-level/src/platforms/macos)
- **Agent Tools**: Reference [src-tauri/src/agent/tools/](mdc:src-tauri/src/agent/tools) for tool integration patterns

### Dependencies Management
- Avoid adding new dependencies when existing ones suffice
- Use conditional compilation for platform-specific code
- Leverage existing crates: `objc`, `base64::Engine`, `image`

### Error Handling Patterns
```rust
match existing_function() {
    Ok(result) => {
        log::debug!("Success: {:?}", result);
        Some(result)
    }
    Err(e) => {
        log::debug!("Fallback needed: {}", e);
        None // or fallback implementation
    }
}
```

